  "body": "intake: goal — the operator ruled runtime derivation on 2026-11-12, so the pick this issue waited on (where a scheduled re-cut PR runs, as which identity) no longer exists; the work is Goal #3305 with four queued children (#3306 → #3307 → #3308 → #3309), and #3309 deletes this issue's gap row.\nblocked-on: issue=3305\n\nRulings carried, all the operator's, 2026-11-12: on the exec — \"is this the best solution we can come up with? exec into a pod? Why not do it properly with interfaces, S3, database, etc?\"; on committed lists against runtime — \"I am also leaning towards runtime. But with some monitoring, S3, grafana, etc. Can all be added later when it works already.\"; on a gateway that holds no derivation — \"2 defer\"; on the budget — \"put €30 or so\". Body and title rewritten to what stays open (the earlier bodies are in the edit history); labels unchanged.\n",
